# Netlify redirects
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# IMPORTANT: there is deliberately NO catch-all /*  ->  /index.html rule here.
# This site is a normal static site, so every file (css, js, images, product
# photos) must be served from its real path. A catch-all would return the
# index.html HTML for image requests and every product photo would break.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Serve the Decap CMS admin panel at /admin without needing the .html suffix.
/admin      /admin/index.html   200

# Send the bare root to the catalogue.
/           /index.html         200
